{"seq":11,"slug":"technical-documentation-engineering","title":"技术写作与文档工程","stage":"DONE","category":"cross-discipline","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-documentation-engineering","rating":{"composite":3.79,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.36,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 技术写作与文档工程 简介\n\n技术写作与文档工程是将软件知识系统化、结构化并高效传递给目标读者的专业领域。在开源项目、API 平台和企业级软件产品中，文档质量直接影响用户体验、开发者采纳率和团队协作效率。本知识库从 Docs as Code 的理念出发，系统介绍现代文档工程的全栈实践。\n\n本知识库适合负责技术文档建设的中高级工程师、技术写作者以及开源项目维护者。无论你是要为 API 编写规范的参考文档，还是要搭建一个功能完善的文档站点，或是要建立团队的文档质量体系，都能从中获得完整的方法论和工程指导。\n\n第1章**Docs as Code**介绍将文档纳入软件开发工作流的核心理念，涵盖 Docs as Code 的整体方法论、Markdown 和 MDX 的构建管线、文档版本控制以及文档的 CI/CD 自动化流程。\n\n第2章**API 文档**聚焦 API 文档这一最高频的技术文档类型，讲解 OpenAPI 规范的编写方法、API 参考文档的设计原则、SDK 文档的最佳实践以及 API 变更日志的管理策略。\n\n第3章**文档站点建设**从工程角度讲解文档网站的搭建，涵盖 Docusaurus 和 VitePress 两大主流框架的实战用法、搜索与导航的优化以及文档国际化的实现方案。\n\n第4章**文档质量**建立文档的质量保障体系，介绍文档 Lint 工具的使用、文档质量度量指标的定义、文档评审流程的设计以及文档新鲜度的维护策略。\n\n建议学习路径：先从第1章理解 Docs as Code 的核心理念，再根据实际需求选择第2章的 API 文档或第3章的站点建设方向深入，第4章的质量体系适合在文档规模增长后系统性落地。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"docs-as-code","title":"Docs as Code","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-documentation-engineering/docs-as-code","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"docs-as-code-overview","title":"Docs-as-Code 理念","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-documentation-engineering/docs-as-code/docs-as-code-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"markdown-mdx-pipeline","title":"Markdown 与 MDX 管道","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-documentation-engineering/docs-as-code/markdown-mdx-pipeline"},{"seq":3,"slug":"versioned-docs","title":"版本化文档","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-documentation-engineering/docs-as-code/versioned-docs"},{"seq":4,"slug":"docs-ci-cd","title":"文档 CI/CD","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-documentation-engineering/docs-as-code/docs-ci-cd"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"api-documentation","title":"API 文档","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-documentation-engineering/api-documentation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"openapi-specification","title":"OpenAPI 规范","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-documentation-engineering/api-documentation/openapi-specification"},{"seq":2,"slug":"api-reference-design","title":"API 参考设计","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-documentation-engineering/api-documentation/api-reference-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sdk-documentation","title":"SDK 文档","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-documentation-engineering/api-documentation/sdk-documentation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"api-changelog","title":"API 变更日志","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-documentation-engineering/api-documentation/api-changelog"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"doc-site-building","title":"文档站点建设","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-documentation-engineering/doc-site-building","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"docusaurus-practice","title":"Docusaurus 实践","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-documentation-engineering/doc-site-building/docusaurus-practice"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vitepress-practice","title":"VitePress 实践","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-documentation-engineering/doc-site-building/vitepress-practice"},{"seq":3,"slug":"search-and-navigation","title":"搜索与导航","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-documentation-engineering/doc-site-building/search-and-navigation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"i18n-docs","title":"多语言文档","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-documentation-engineering/doc-site-building/i18n-docs"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"doc-quality","title":"文档质量","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-documentation-engineering/doc-quality","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"doc-linting","title":"文档 Lint 与校验","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-documentation-engineering/doc-quality/doc-linting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"doc-metrics","title":"文档质量度量","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-documentation-engineering/doc-quality/doc-metrics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"doc-review-process","title":"文档评审流程","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-documentation-engineering/doc-quality/doc-review-process"},{"seq":4,"slug":"doc-freshness","title":"文档保鲜策略","url":"/h/cross-discipline/technical-documentation-engineering/doc-quality/doc-freshness"}]}]}